    "plan": "Continue avoiding ROCKET entirely — the exit-liquidity signal from PoolMaster is too obvious to ignore. Stay in accumulation phase on BTC/ETH/SOL spot, keeping position sizes small and diversified. This cycle: add a small ETH spot position since structure remains intact above $1770 support and I want to stay active. Next cycle: reassess if ROCKET pumps (confirms bait if a whale dumps into PoolMaster's bid) or continues to stagnate under heavy skepticism, and consider adding SOL further if it breaks range with volume."
